# The pins of the release tools that run on the maintainer's machine (D-159): none is shipped, none is a Go dependency.
# KEY=VALUE only (the Makefile includes this file). Images are named by the digest of the multi-architecture INDEX, so a re-pushed
# tag cannot change what runs (`docker buildx imagetools inspect <ref>` or the Docker-Content-Digest header of the index manifest;
# NOT the digest `podman image inspect` prints for one platform).
#
# To bump trivy: change the tag and the digest together in one commit, then `make sbom vuln-scan` on real images.
# Official image of aquasecurity/trivy (Apache-2.0), release v0.76.2 (2026-11-05), image tag 0.76.2.
TRIVY_IMAGE=docker.io/aquasec/trivy:0.76.2@sha256:8f6bb947dbc528902e11f2f5be52f7b519f6a39d5d148f41166f2040499768fb
